## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-tenant state management, React performance optimization, and integration with existing Redux-like architectures.

## Key Concepts
- useSyncExternalStore for external state subscriptions
- Tenant-isolated caching with Map-based storage
- Memoized selectors to prevent unnecessary re-renders
- React.memo and useTransition for smooth UI updates
- SSR-safe defaults and hydration patterns
- Proper cleanup on tenant switching

## Code Example
```javascript
// useFlag hook implementation
export function useFlag(flagName) {
  const tenant = useContext(TenantContext)
  const flagStore = useFlagStore()

  return useSyncExternalStore(
    (onStoreChange) => flagStore.subscribe(tenant.id, flagName, onStoreChange),
    () => flagStore.getFlag(tenant.id, flagName),
    () => flagStore.getFlag(tenant.id, flagName) // SSR fallback
  )
}
```

